::ingredients

(flour; bread) 5 cups
(salt) 2 1/2tsp
(water) up to 2 cups, may not all be needed
(butter; unsalted, softened) 2 cups

::equipment

(rolling pin)
(bowl, large) -OR- (mixer, stand, dough hook)
(refrigerator)

::instructions

(butter) <place, between two pieces of plastic wrap>
    <pound, flat disc, rolling pin or heavy object>
    <refrigerate, until firm, ~20m>
(flour) + (salt) <mix, large bowl or stand mixer with dough hook>
{dough} = (flour) + (salt) + (water)
{dough} <stir, water gradually, only enough to clean bowl sides, neither sticky nor dry>
    <rest, at least 10m>
    <roll, lightly floured surface, large rectangle ~1/2in thick>
    + (butter) <place, centre>
{dough} <fold, two ends over butter to enclose>
    <roll, ~1/2in thick, do not let butter break through>
    <fold, thirds>
    <refrigerate, 30m as butter warms>
Repeat [
    {dough} <roll>
        <fold>
]
two more times
{dough} <refrigerate, until firm>
Repeat [
    {dough} <roll>
        <fold>
]
two or more times until rolled roughly 6 times in total
{pastry} <wrap>
    <refrigerate>
    <roll, for use, ~1/4in thin>
    <bake, 400f for best results>

